  id: Scene09_FAQ_1
  speaker: WATTSON
  text: Because we want the ammeter to measure the current through the nichrome wire.
    In series, the ammeter is part of the same single path, so every bit of charge
    that passes through the wire also passes through the ammeter. Same path, same
    current.
